# Spice St. Market — Cursor Rules

project_goals:
  - Faithful static port of the Webflow brand site for Cloudflare Workers.
  - Preserve Webflow markup, shared CSS, custom code, and spice imagery.
  - Match spicest.webflow.io / spicestmarket.com visually; enhance motion without redesigning.

editing_guidelines:
  - Preserve indentation and formatting.
  - Avoid unrelated refactors; keep edits tightly scoped.
  - Do not rename asset paths in source/cdn without updating scrape/build URL rewrites.
  - Prefer small, self-contained edits with descriptive commit messages.

technology_direction:
  - Port scraped Webflow HTML; do not invent a parallel design system.
  - Keep jQuery, webflow.js chunks, Swiper stacks, GSAP custom embeds intact.
  - Optional Lenis + View Transitions in src/js/enhance.js and src/styles/enhance.css.
  - Respect prefers-reduced-motion for the enhance layer only.
  - Build pipeline: scrape → rewrite URLs / copy CDN → dist/ → wrangler deploy.

repository_conventions:
  - Automation in scripts/
  - Thin enhance layer in src/
  - Untouched scrape baseline in source/
  - Commit messages: chore|feat|fix|docs: short description

brand:
  - Colors: spice-red #510604, orange #da522a, honey-mustard #ffda88, dijon #f8e7c2, wheat #fff8e7, navy #13172a, light-green #85eba8
  - Tagline: If you ain't sneezin, you ain't seasonin
  - CTAs drive to Amazon spice packs

accessibility:
  - Preserve Webflow keyboard nav for tabs and sliders
  - Sufficient contrast; no motion-only information
